      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "LOx fueling has begun for our 99th Electron launch in just 1.5 hours' time.\n\nRange Control update from Launch Complex 1 in New Zealand:\n🌤️ Weather: 90% GO.\n⏱️ Lift-off: Scheduled for 05:41am NZ local time. 16:41 UTC.",
