      "text": "Electron is vertical on Pad A at Launch Complex 1 to begin fueling.\n\nMission details for today's 99th Electron launch \"The Sea God Surveys\":\n🎯 Repeat customer: @QPS_Inc\n🛰️ Payload: 1x QPS-SAR satellite\n🌏 Orbit: 575km LEO\n📍 Inclination: 42 degrees",
